        "approval_date": "2007-10-12",
        "description": {
          "text": "Added combination therapy with a sulfonylurea (alone or with metformin) and a non-inferiority study vs glipizide added on to metformin",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "S-002: Additions to the Package Insert (PI) describing the results of (1) a study of combination therapy with a sulfonylurea when the single agent alone does not provide adequate glycemic control and in combination therapy with a sulfonylurea plus metformin when dual therapy does not provide adequate glycemic control, and (2) a non-inferiority study comparing Januvia to glipizide in patients without adequate glycemic control on metformin.",
              "doc_id": "49d74f0e-e894-51e8-80ed-3602253ea591",
              "line": 7
            }
